MODULE: OneTerminalRetires
TARGET: NoPrematureRetirement
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: rebuild treats one captured shard commit as a batch-wide decision
PERTURBS: Swap

--- FIND
    /\ abandoned' = (abandoned /\ ~AllCommitted(heads))
--- REPLACE
    /\ abandoned' = (abandoned /\ ~(\E p \in TerminalPartitions : heads[p] = LastOffset(p)))
--- END
